## 10. Critical Open Questions

Tracked in [OPENQUESTIONS.md](./OPENQUESTIONS.md). Highest priority:
1. **SW update lifecycle** — publish-to-client propagation guarantees (CHM-1).
2. **Worker size budget** — engine + console + proxy within platform limits (CHM-3).
3. **Registered-query authoring** — how developers/agents declare queries the proxy will accept (CHM-4).
4. **Pricing & open-source split** — core free/MIT vs builder monetization (PRD-1/PRD-2).
5. **Legacy layout migration** — version-flagged migration of existing JSON layouts (ARC-3).

